---
import "../styles/global.scss";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const title: string = "Frontend development | Owen Portfolio";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import card1 from "../assets/frontend/card1.png";
import card2 from "../assets/frontend/card2.png";
import card3 from "../assets/frontend/card3.png";
import card4 from "../assets/frontend/card4.png";
import card5 from "../assets/frontend/card5.png";
import card6 from "../assets/frontend/card6.png";
import card7 from "../assets/frontend/card7.png";
import card8 from "../assets/frontend/card8.png";
import blendbetterMac from "../assets/frontend/blendbetterMac.png";
import blendbetterMobile from "../assets/frontend/blendbetterMobile.png";
import blendbetterApple from "../assets/frontend/blendbetterApple.png";
import jokeshare from "../assets/frontend/jokeshare.png";
import zustand from "../assets/frontend/zustand.png";
import lodash from "../assets/frontend/lodash.png";
import kitchen1 from "../assets/frontend/kitchen1.png";
import kitchen2 from "../assets/frontend/kitchen2.png";
import kitchen3 from "../assets/frontend/kitchen3.png";
import kitchen4 from "../assets/frontend/kitchen4.png";
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <main>
    <section class="introduction">
      <div class="left">
        <h1><span>Design and Develop</span>Frontend</h1>
        <p class="intro-frontend">
          Frontend development is my favourite. When designing pages and
          components for users, seeing those beautiful and practical tools
          appear on the screen in real time is what excites me the most. With
          numerous frameworks and libraries available now, along with
          component-based development in React, our development efficiency has
          greatly improved.
        </p>
        <div class="technologies">
          <p>Frameworks | React, React Native, Next.js, Astro, SwiftUI, Vue3</p>
          <p>CSS | Tailwind CSS, Sass, Shadcn UI, Elementor Plus</p>
          <p>Libraries | Redux, Zustand, Pinia, Axios, Lucide Icons</p>
          <p>Other | PHP, TypeScript, Lottie Animations, Figma</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="right">
        <div class="image-card card1">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={card1}
            alt="Card for weather"
            width={356}
            height={99}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="image-card card2">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={card2}
            alt="Card for tab bar"
            width={298}
            height={55}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="image-card card3">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={card3}
            alt="Card for BlendBetter App"
            width={151}
            height={328}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="image-card card4">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={card4}
            alt="Card for Owen's Kitchen"
            width={621}
            height={419}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="image-card card5">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={card5}
            alt="Card for Jokeshare"
            width={349}
            height={287}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="image-card card6">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={card6}
            alt="Card BlendBetter web"
            width={316}
            height={201}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="image-card card7">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={card7}
            alt="Card for Vue project"
            width={253}
            height={125}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="image-card card8">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={card8}
            alt="Card for Tailwind CSS"
            width={143}
            height={250}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-2">
      <div class="section-2-left">
        <Image
          class="blendbetter-mac"
          src={blendbetterMac}
          alt="Blendbetter"
          width={980 * 0.8}
          height={596 * 0.8}
        />
        <Image
          class="blendbetter-mobile"
          src={blendbetterMobile}
          alt="Blendbetter"
          width={195}
          height={406}
        />
      </div>
      <div class="section-2-right">
        <h2>Next.js Project</h2>
        <p>
          BlendBetter is a multi-platform project. On the desktop side, I
          developed it using Next.js, whose routing system is very convenient,
          by organizing different pages as folders, I could automatically create
          the website’s routes. With the help of Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui, the
          interface development was highly efficient. The sidebar design makes
          the site’s features clear at a glance, and Lucide Icons provide a
          clean visual style that makes buttons easy to recognize while reducing
          users’ reading effort.
        </p>
        <p>
          These advantages allowed me to complete the desktop version quickly. I
          then developed the mobile version using React Native, enabling
          BlendBetter to better serve both iOS and Android users with greater
          convenience in the kitchen.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-3">
      <div class="section-3-left">
        <h2>SwiftUI Rebuilding BlendBetter</h2>
        <p>
          After implementing the core mobile features with React Native, I set
          higher expectations for the project. This time, I wanted to use an
          on-device model to directly recognize fruit types. To better achieve
          this, I rebuilt the entire project using SwiftUI and leveraged Apple’s
          Vision framework.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a result, on iOS, users can directly use the camera to scan the
          fruits they have.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="section-3-middle">
        <Image
          class="blendbetter-apple"
          src={blendbetterApple}
          alt="Blendbetter detects fruits"
          width={1300 * 0.3}
          height={2642 * 0.3}
        />
      </div>
      <div class="section-3-right">
        <p>
          The app is currently in the final stage of development, and it is
          expected to be launched on the App Store within the next few weeks.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/appStore.png"
          width={320 * 0.5}
          height={108 * 0.5}
          alt="App Store"
        />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-4">
      <div class="section-4-left">
        <h2>React Project<span>Single Page App</span></h2>
        <p>
          Jokeshare is a typical React SPA project. In this web app, any user
          can browse and upload jokes, like and comment on them, and sort jokes
          by number of likes or by most recent. Users can also save jokes using
          the Collections feature.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="section-4-right">
        <Image
          src={jokeshare}
          alt="Jokeshare"
          width={1387 * 0.75}
          height={899 * 0.75}
        />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-5">
      <div class="section-5-content">
        <p>
          In this SPA project, I used Zustand for global state management.
          Compared to Redux, Zustand is more lightweight, simpler, and more
          efficient, which allowed me to implement the favourites feature very
          quickly.
        </p>
        <p>
          For state persistence, I used Zustand’s built-in persist middleware,
          ensuring that users’ favorited jokes are saved locally and can be
          loaded again the next time they visit the website.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="section-5-image">
        <Image
          class="zustand"
          src={zustand}
          alt="Zustand"
          width={1371 * 0.7}
          height={941 * 0.7}
        />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-6">
      <div class="section-6-content">
        <p>
          I also used Lodash’s sorting utilities to implement dynamic joke
          ordering. When users click the sorting controls, a click event is
          triggered that applies different sorting strategies: one displays
          jokes in descending order based on the counts of likes, and the
          another one shows the newest jokes first based on their creation time.
        </p>
        <p>
          This approach keeps the sorting logic clean and efficient while
          providing users with a smooth way to switch between “Most Liked” and
          “Latest” views.
        </p>
        <div class="section-6-buttons">
          <img
            src="/likeButton.png"
            alt="Like Button"
            width={160}
            height={35}
          />
          <img
            src="/recentButton.png"
            alt="Recent Button"
            width={169}
            height={35}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-6-lodash">
        <Image
          class="jokeshare-lodash"
          src={lodash}
          alt="Lodash"
          width={1285 * 0.75}
          height={873 * 0.75}
        />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-7">
      <div class="section-7-left">
        <div class="kitchen-card kitchen1">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={kitchen1}
            alt="Card for Owen's Kitchen"
            width={2072}
            height={1046}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="kitchen-card kitchen2">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={kitchen2}
            alt="Card for Owen's Kitchen"
            width={2053}
            height={1243}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="kitchen-card kitchen3">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={kitchen3}
            alt="Card for Owen's Kitchen"
            width={2063}
            height={1243}
          />
        </div>
        <div class="kitchen-card kitchen4">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            src={kitchen4}
            alt="Card for Owen's Kitchen"
            width={2076}
            height={1241}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-7-right">
        <h2>Owen's Kitchen <span>PHP Project</span></h2>
        <p>
          Today, PHP still plays a very important role in development,
          especially for full-stack projects and applications that need to be
          built quickly. I enjoy cooking and sharing food, and Owen’s Kitchen is
          a project built with PHP and MySQL.
        </p>
        <p>
          It allows users to browse dishes, add items to a cart, leave notes
          (such as marking allergies to certain dishes), confirm orders, and
          view their balance and bills.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <style lang="scss">
      main {
        scroll-snap-type: y mandatory;
        overflow-y: scroll;
        height: 100vh;
        h1 {
          font-size: 4.8rem;
          font-weight: 100;
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
          animation: fadeIn-slightly 0.7s ease-in-out both;
          animation-delay: 0.2s;
          span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.5;
            animation: fadeIn-slightly 0.6s ease-in-out both;
          }
        }
        p {
          font-size: 1.2rem;
          font-weight: 100;
          line-height: 1.5;
        }

        section {
          scroll-snap-align: start;
          height: 100vh;
          width: 100vw;
          display: flex;
          justify-content: center;
          align-items: center;
          max-width: 2400px;
          margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .introduction {
          max-width: 2400px;
          gap: 8rem;
          margin: 0 auto;

          .left {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 2rem;
            width: 45%;
            padding-left: 10%;
            .intro-frontend {
              animation: fadeIn-opacity 0.2s ease-in-out both;
              animation-delay: 0.3s;
            }
            .technologies {
              display: flex;
              flex-direction: column;
              justify-content: center;
              align-items: flex-start;
              gap: 0.4rem;
              animation: fadeIn-opacity 0.2s ease-in-out both;
              animation-delay: 0.4s;
              p {
                font-size: 1.05rem;
              }
            }
          }
          .right {
            width: 55%;
            padding-right: 10%;
            position: relative;
            height: 750px;
            display: flex;

            &:hover {
              .card1 {
                transform: translate3d(-30px, -10px, 0);
              }
              .card2 {
                transform: translate3d(0, -30px, 0);
              }
              .card3 {
                transform: translate3d(10px, 60px, 0);
              }
              .card4 {
                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
              }
              .card5 {
                transform: translate3d(-5px, 5px, 0);
              }
              .card6 {
                transform: translate3d(0px, -30px, 0);
              }
              .card7 {
                transform: translate3d(40px, -20px, 0);
              }
              .card8 {
                transform: translate3d(0, -30px, 0);
              }
            }

            .image-card {
              position: absolute;
              border-radius: 16px;
              box-shadow: 5px 5px 10px 10px rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.4);
              overflow: hidden;
              transform: rotateY(-20deg) rotateX(20deg);
              transition: transform 2s cubic-bezier(0.075, 0.82, 0.165, 1);

              img {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
              }
            }
            .card1 {
              width: 356px;
              height: 99px;
              top: 50px;
              left: 0px;
              z-index: 1;
            }
            .card2 {
              width: 298px;
              height: 55px;
              top: 200px;
              left: 0px;
              z-index: 9;
            }
            .card3 {
              width: 151px;
              height: 328px;
              top: 300px;
              left: 30px;
              z-index: 8;
            }
            .card4 {
              width: 621px;
              height: 419px;
              top: 105px;
              left: 150px;
              z-index: 7;
            }
            .card5 {
              width: 349px;
              height: 287px;
              top: 450px;
              left: 250px;
              z-index: 8;
            }
            .card6 {
              width: 316px;
              height: 201px;
              top: 0px;
              left: 450px;
              z-index: 11;
            }
            .card7 {
              width: 253px;
              height: 125px;
              top: 250px;
              left: 550px;
              z-index: 10;
            }
            .card8 {
              width: 143px;
              height: 250px;
              top: 475px;
              left: 690px;
              z-index: 12;
            }
          }
        }

        .section-2 {
          background-image: url("../assets/frontend/blendbetterBG.png");
          background-size: cover;
          background-position: center;
          background-repeat: no-repeat;
          .section-2-left {
            width: 55%;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            .blendbetter-mobile {
              position: absolute;
              bottom: 0px;
              right: 15px;
            }
          }
          .section-2-right {
            width: 45%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 2rem;
            padding-left: 6rem;
            padding-right: 10%;
          }
        }
        .section-3 {
          display: flex;
          justify-content: center;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 2rem;
          .section-3-left {
            width: 33%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 2rem;
            padding-left: 10%;
          }
          .section-3-middle {
            width: 33%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
          }
          .blendbetter-apple {
            animation-timeline: view();
            animation-name: fadeIn-opacity-scroll;
            animation-duration: 1s;
            animation-delay: 0.2s;
            animation-fill-mode: both;
          }
          .section-3-right {
            width: 33%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 2rem;
            padding-right: 10%;
          }
        }

        .section-4 {
          display: flex;
          justify-content: center;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 2rem;
          .section-4-left {
            width: 45%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 2rem;
            padding-left: 10%;
            padding-right: 5%;
            h2 {
              span {
                display: block;
                font-weight: 900;
                line-height: 1.2;
                margin-top: 0.4rem;
              }
            }
          }
          .section-4-right {
            width: 55%;
          }
        }

        .section-5 {
          background-image: url("../assets/frontend/bear.jpg");
          background-size: cover;
          background-position: right;
          background-repeat: no-repeat;
          position: relative;
          .section-5-content {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 17%;
            right: 6%;
            width: 50ch;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
            background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
            padding: 4rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 5px 5px 10px 10px rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            z-index: 2;
          }
          .section-5-image {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15%;
            right: 2%;
            z-index: 1;
          }
        }
        .section-6 {
          position: relative;
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          justify-content: center;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 2rem;
          .section-6-content {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 70ch;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            .section-6-buttons {
              display: flex;
              justify-content: center;
              align-items: center;
              gap: 2rem;
              margin-top: 2rem;
            }
          }

          .section-6-lodash {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30%;
            right: 50%;
            transform: translateX(50%) translateY(50%);
            z-index: 1;
            .jokeshare-lodash {
              animation-timeline: view();
              animation-name: fadeIn-opacity-scroll;
              animation-duration: 1s;
              animation-delay: 0.2s;
              animation-fill-mode: both;
            }
          }
        }

        .section-7 {
          display: flex;
          justify-content: center;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 2rem;
          .section-7-left {
            width: 65%;
            height: 100%;
            padding-left: 10%;
            position: relative;
            .kitchen-card {
              position: absolute;
              border-radius: 16px;
              box-shadow: 5px 5px 10px 10px rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.4);
              overflow: hidden;
              width: 600px;
              animation-timeline: view();
              animation-name: fadeIn-opacity-scroll-slow;
              animation-duration: 1s;
              animation-delay: 0.1s;
              animation-fill-mode: both;
              // animation-range: entry 5% entry 90%;
              img {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
              }
            }
            .kitchen1 {
              top: 20%;
              left: 5%;
              z-index: 1;
            }
            .kitchen2 {
              top: 30%;
              left: 15%;
              z-index: 2;
            }
            .kitchen3 {
              top: 40%;
              left: 25%;
              z-index: 3;
            }
            .kitchen4 {
              top: 50%;
              left: 35%;
              z-index: 4;
            }
          }
          .section-7-right {
            width: 50%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 2rem;
            padding-right: 10%;
            padding-left: 5%;
            h2 {
              span {
                display: block;
                font-weight: 900;
                line-height: 1.2;
                margin-top: 0.4rem;
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    </style>
  </main>
</Layout>
